    "innovation": "This paper presents a transient global climate simulation, forced by North Atlantic freshwater fluxes, demonstrating that a continuum of ice-sheet-driven changes in the Atlantic Meridional Overturning Circulation can realistically reproduce the full spectrum of Dansgaard-Oeschger and Heinrich events from 50 to 30 ka BP.",
