            "paragraph": "The ocean component of LOVECLIM (CLIO) consists of a free-surface primitive equation model with a horizontal resolution of 3\u00b0 longitude, 3\u00b0 latitude, and 20 depth layers. The 3-D atmospheric component (ECBilt) is a spectral T21, three-level model based on quasi-geostrophic equations of motion and ageostrophic corrections. LOVECLIM also includes a dynamic-thermodynamic sea-ice model, a land surface scheme, a dynamic global vegetation model (VECODE, Brovkin et al., 1997) and a marine carbon cycle model (LOCH, Menviel et al., 2008; Mouchet, 2011).",
